# expect: reject PLN-02
# rate=nan, scale=inf, a module channel without rate and one without range_mv.
# CAN: heartbeat 4 B = 8*4+47+floor(65/4)=95 bit; data 8 B = 8*8+47+floor(97/4)=135 bit
# CAN: modules used 2 -> 2*95 = 190 bit/s; groups m2g0@100, m2g2@10, m3g0@10
# CAN: sum of group rates 120 Hz -> 120*135 = 16200 bit/s; total 16390 bit/s = 3.278 % of 500 kbit/s (limit 300000)
# TLM: total sample rate 120 Hz -> 1.2 samples per 10 ms frame -> 1 packet(s); 9*1.2 + 1*(22+4+66) = 102.8 B/frame * 100 * 8 = 82240 bit/s (limit 2000000)
